          "id": 2501763114,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Alexis, do you know which parts of the WIFI specs are little or big endian?  There are lots of FT_UINT<n> fields that are ENC_NA, which corresponds to ENC_BIG_ENDIAN (see pipeline), but it'd be good to sure that they were correct before changing them to an explicit flag.",
